  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"\" separators=\"|\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>:</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>2</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>:</mo></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>:</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math><br />Continuity at <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8757;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo></math> continuous at <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br />&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><msup><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8757;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><msup><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo></msup></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mn>1</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><msup><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mfenced></math></p><p><math><mo>&#8756;</mo></math> continuous at <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br />For differentiability,<br /><math> <mrow> <msup> <mi>f</mi> <mo>&#8242;</mo> </msup> <mfenced> <mi>x</mi> </mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\"> <mrow> <mtable columnalign=\"left\" equalcolumns=\"true\" equalrows=\"true\"> <mtr columnalign=\"left\"> <mtd columnalign=\"left\"> <mrow> <mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow> </mtd> <mtd columnalign=\"left\"> <mrow> <mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow> </mtd> </mtr> <mtr columnalign=\"left\"> <mtd columnalign=\"left\"> <mn>0</mn> </mtd> <mtd columnalign=\"left\"> <mrow> <mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow> </mtd> </mtr> <mtr columnalign=\"left\"> <mtd columnalign=\"left\"> <mn>1</mn> </mtd> <mtd columnalign=\"left\"> <mrow> <mi>x</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow> </mtd> </mtr> </mtable></mrow> </mfenced></mrow> </math><br />at <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math>,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">'</mi></msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><msup><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><msup><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo